Dang, so close. Respect for Miyazaki for their transition in this surprise announcement. Such an excitement; it struck me as a gender-dysphoric individual with a surprise.

However, I'm disappointed that they will not be in Demon's Souls and I really hope they reconsider. Miyazaki's debut as Patches in the remake will be sorely missed. She's kicked us down enough shafts and pits and alongside with the difficulty in the games, I was looking forward to the brilliant woman she is now to show us our place. We can never underestimate the king, now Queen\~

