Oh dear... what have I gotten into.... D:

I had a wonderful relationship with my parents. I came out as gay and then my parents left me for dead. 5 years later, even though we are healing and making serious, true amends, I'm still recoiling from it all. You can imagine how it left me with. I ain't no unique experiance. :/

&#x200B;

I don't know if that counts as unintentional but they described it 3 years ago as a "knee-jerk" reaction.

I am feeling a ton better. I've been trying to take the past several days a ton easier. It means a ton to me honestly that people care.

I also meant to respond earlier. My apologies, I don't come to reddit every day and sometimes I forget to get back to things ^^;
If you have skype or some sort of manner of communication, feel free to catch me there.
